    {# Who is this information for? #}
    <h2 class="nhsuk-heading-l nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-3">Who is this information for?</h2>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">This guidance is intended for NHS Trusts, Cancer Alliances and clinical and operational leads involved in exploring or supporting the introduction of self-referral services.</p>

    <hr class="nhsuk-section-break nhsuk-section-break--l">

    {# What does onboarding involve? #}
    <h2 class="nhsuk-heading-l nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-3">What does onboarding involve?</h2>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">The onboarding process typically includes:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Identifying key clinical and operational leads.</li>
        <li>Understanding existing referral pathways and local processes.</li>
        <li>Agreeing how self-referrals will be received, managed and processed.</li>
        <li>Establishing clinical governance, safety and operational arrangements.</li>
        <li>Agreeing data collection, reporting and communication requirements.</li>
        <li>Completing pathway testing and confirming readiness for go-live.</li>
    </ul>

